```python
def norm(s):
    s = unicodedata.normalize("NFKC", s or "")
    s = s.replace("$", " ").replace("\\", " ")
    s = re.sub(r"[^0-9a-zA-Z]+", " ", s.lower())
    return re.sub(r"\s+", " ", s).strip()
```

